{"job_id":"F-5657e0b980dce9dbaad4","family_id":"F-5657e0b980dce9dbaad4","title":"공증인의 정원 및 신원보증금에 관한 규칙","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006365-102647-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":22,"target_id":"90012dd1b162b4cf0fd4d4152bf410d8bea0cbaec8857df38ba1abb95e820524","source_hash":"e5d89f73a26d9a9fc1befba0a29c77ea1f423f486d2950af04dafbe0d645f3fc","text":"关于公证员配额和保证金的规定"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006365-102647-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":163,"target_id":"36e705f743c72ed5d5a9a487b37331134cd632062eaf5fa14d185c9079dba6c6","source_hash":"cb6054d909689a9bc467b91497b9f8f7c213863ed004488bb274ac0b3bcf214f","text":"第一条（目的）本规则的目的是确定依据《公证人法》（以下简称“本法”）第十条第二款规定的公证人人数、依据第十一条第二款和第十五条之二第二款规定的公证人委任或授权申请，以及依据第十八条第二款规定的公证人应缴纳的保证金数额。<1981年6月19日修订；2010年2月5日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006365-102647-ko","scope":"BODY","start":163,"end":201,"target_id":"2ff5410ea894bfb6cf35e09d337daa1eb1dee6e2616883daee57b60adf286211","source_hash":"8cae04b82c5f40adc753739019405cb28699a97e9444d0633061e729e4764402","text":"第二条（人员配额）各区检察机关公证员的人员配额按附表1规定执行。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006365-102647-ko","scope":"BODY","start":201,"end":365,"target_id":"be8e633b229454b8b289735413e3e9c75473ab9ef0aaf5e8160db8286bf2efbe","source_hash":"6ebae0507e56c9b7ee07b2a3485c53512dd25a7f97d476c654e230fd0e54024b","text":"第2-2条（公证人委任申请及公证人授权）\n① 凡欲依本法第十一条第二款申请委任公证人者，应当依本法所附表格1向司法部长提交申请。\n② 任何打算根据本法第十五条之二第2款申请公证授权的人，应当按照本法所附表格2向司法部长提交申请。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006365-102647-ko","scope":"BODY","start":365,"end":841,"target_id":"a4bae2465f6db6769afd9e63b45091722c326d35b2956e13c0caa386589c8a79","source_hash":"0bfe38fc6330da68e1484fe2b5de54875be2cfc2d205b1bdd5dcf66b72c6b8d9","text":"第三条（身份保证金等金额）\n① 根据本法第十八条第一款规定应缴纳的保证金数额，应按附表二规定缴纳。但是，获授权的公证员应当为每位负责公证的律师缴纳附表二所列数额的保证金。<2004年5月10日修订，2010年2月5日修订>\n② 根据第1款规定缴纳的保证金，可以直接以现金缴纳​​，也可以存入所属地方检察院非收入非支出现金出纳员的账户，或者以金融机构开具的、由缴纳保证金的义务人和所属地方检察院非收入非支出现金出纳员共同出具的存款凭证的形式存入所属地方检察院，或者以可以替代保证金的担保保险单的形式存入（该担保保险单在未履行本法第19条规定的支付公告费用的义务时，必须作为抵押品；以下本条亦适用）。\n③ 如果身份担保金以担保保险凭证的形式存入，且该凭证可以替代身份担保金，则公证人未在收到付款通知后7天内支付公证费，保险公司的保险金应支付该费用。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006365-102647-ko","scope":"BODY","start":841,"end":977,"target_id":"17f3b59d815e4f604924861747977aabba34069123ec9e13b7c828537c36bddc","source_hash":"80d3a12b732516dbae8353af9b96df4c6839432f146a30ac2da3d7073fe5f69c","text":"第四条（退还保证金通知）\n① 根据本法第十九条第一款的规定，退还保证金的公告应当由公证员所属的地区检察厅检察长发布。\n② 第1款所述公告应当在官方公报上刊登，并至少在日报上刊登两次。<1981年6月19日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006365-102647-ko","scope":"BODY","start":977,"end":1019,"target_id":"ee555fcc6ce1b95646970fe281d53ce10d6e59ae3a0b6ad71db6bbc02b9c6725","source_hash":"a6b773fb31df8f4ccd9eee875fb79d94ef052bcb9b72b716fd6019be64c536d6","text":"补充规定 <第113号，1969年6月3日>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006365-102647-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1019,"end":1061,"target_id":"c03cbc450b8bffa5db88dc90660e945a81f1816a6f9f949aa3264f8f5083e677","source_hash":"669d33ae91800b3b222eadac7bae2260aebe5a6e153fb71fc4fe7dca97b44d0c","text":"补充条款 <第171号，1970年8月6日>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00009","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006365-102647-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1061,"end":1174,"target_id":"e0643475674ad412c0089a15e60519839c2f7af6f8ef18da4018cf00aa42f4be","source_hash":"250a4575065e2f6f293ecdf9c2a60512234e84e4858775111fdaacb4d7d5c2f9","text":"补充条款 <第173号，1971年2月22日>\n\n①（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。\n\n②（过渡措施）本法令生效时已取得公证资格的公证人应自本法令生效之日起一个月内，按照本法令缴纳保证金。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00010","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006365-102647-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1174,"end":1217,"target_id":"32cc2c1d3fc6accba18e80a842506bc67e1ded73fc5113448272ae6b05c9bad3","source_hash":"4ee64b8dd700c545949c9ba548f9291351a6c2dea92b609d37af8241047b7bc2","text":"补充条款 <第210号，1979年3月10日>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00011","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006365-102647-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1217,"end":1261,"target_id":"5cc249a8635fed6223b3473461f2e1e2d346ee0cd003acf14f393f3fd81e2f42","source_hash":"48b0215dc74490d47ad27fbb49158e012feef13e57f5f67bd645be21c9bce43e","text":"补充规定 <第224号，1981年6月19日>\n\n本规则自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00012","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006365-102647-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1261,"end":1308,"target_id":"eef3a6a872da9be260989d845b290124d48bbdb51486c7884dfa5a9c8ee1d74d","source_hash":"68d1ce2fcf759b6a43d07d6d6681bafc5084eab7b0b63e9262865b4a84beb4cc","text":"补充规定 <第258号，1983年8月30日>\n\n本规则自1983年9月1日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00013","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006365-102647-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1308,"end":1579,"target_id":"e8972925418ca8024287cf0169f289caf5adc846f26f6eb70700b24e04f01cbb","source_hash":"741405dc180848afda3919a5aa8cfb40523b19a827f8630524f59c550b04e5cd","text":"补充规定 <第288号，1986年8月30日>\n\n①（生效日期）本规则自公布之日起生效。\n\n  ②（过渡措施）在本规则生效之日已按先前规定缴纳保证金的公证员和律师事务所或合伙律师事务所成员，应当自本规则生效之日起三个月内，按附件二修订后的规定缴纳保证金；但该保证金可以按照第三条第二款修订后的规定，以保证金凭证等形式缴纳。在此情况下，未按修订后的规定提交保证金凭证等，不得要求退还先前缴纳的保证金。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00014","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006365-102647-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1579,"end":1622,"target_id":"2e6eb83c01553d9b2d687783aa0ed7327755f0ac14cffffa9ce4277e5d23e437","source_hash":"74731fc092f6076c8434fef30b8c42637861cd1fce8afdc54d3ca46957ed36fd","text":"补充规定 <第552号，2004年5月10日>\n\n本规则自颁布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00015","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006365-102647-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1622,"end":1643,"target_id":"1eb111263423847baa9e3e6f8a5b72589f2d6e36931d56a3c9e1aacb1abd8a99","source_hash":"9a34375d6b64a1f7e9982e5ea6e96b430e7fa3abd589d02fcea788ab0f8e4141","text":"补充规定 <第694号，2010年2月5日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00016","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006365-102647-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1643,"end":1679,"target_id":"a92fae5b7f42d25d6cbd6ede7338e41284bfae3f71fd530747475ce3e3883c80","source_hash":"782b6d935b1237a0f5f6639257d6877e11d5e0defb8b8908b543981b80494824","text":"第一条（生效日期）本规则自2010年2月7日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00017","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006365-102647-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1679,"end":1803,"target_id":"4868ecc5fcf71675be9c274a3ba2472e8f4ea1d942a369cd5da51764adaca643","source_hash":"09c8d6ab092f3d46cb92e4770342bc8127973342ef3d7e40ca146615cd37f259","text":"第二条（配额过渡措施）如果在本规则实施时，现有获授权公证人的数量超过本规则规定的获授权公证人配额，则对于超出部分，应视作存在单独的配额，直到现有数量等于本规则规定的配额为止。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00018","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-006365-102647-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1803,"end":1963,"target_id":"9e114b06149569c0f7b894d419355aaf59ace764a32dfbfea3ecb0bd271be5b1","source_hash":"aae0904b0baa1d728fb97b25c93a4c98222fe85d286f7e8699b3b76b116b2c26","text":"第三条（关于保证金的过渡措施）在本规则实施前缴纳保证金的公证人，应当在本规则实施之日起三个月内，缴纳根据附件二修订规定缴纳的保证金数额减去原附件二规定的保证金数额计算出的金额。\n\n各区检察机关公证员名额（与第二条有关）\n"},{"id":"A32812-zh-00001","doc":"A32812","law_id":"kr-006365-102647-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2388807","source_hash":"468d9fe9578677c77a1ea4544100250abfef51eed06627d04d9559b2172e1d3c","text":"[附录 1] <修订于 2010.2.5>"},{"id":"A32812-zh-00002","doc":"A32812","law_id":"kr-006365-102647-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2388808","source_hash":"195ace983e0cd9895bcd06cb0e27d812bfbf43091df8f40335cfdc649b912391","text":"各区检察机关公证员名额（与第二条有关）"},{"id":"A32812-zh-00003","doc":"A32812","law_id":"kr-006365-102647-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2388809","source_hash":"788d4524204121a3b88468dc90eabf383e30826c2c4e9d33a97b6718f9e38f0b","text":"地区检察官办公室"},{"id":"A32812-zh-00004","doc":"A32812","law_id":"kr-006365-102647-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2388810","source_hash":"d5c971809d22cbbd40663910f0161453ff7277ba391349648690739aac5d1d09","text":"花园"},{"id":"A32812-zh-00005","doc":"A32812","law_id":"kr-006365-102647-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2388811","source_hash":"69b9692b3a62eb011f4604d5b88779a151e930b25877d3eb2cbe048a13f3c801","text":"指定公证人"},{"id":"A32812-zh-00006","doc":"A32812","law_id":"kr-006365-102647-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2388812","source_hash":"2ca4a956cf95c4e0533fde3195aadf8ed59ec93c744d098a7fa12f6964bdd9cb","text":"公证人"},{"id":"A32812-zh-00007","doc":"A32812","law_id":"kr-006365-102647-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2388813","source_hash":"ee89b978d4b796ff850ced7ab41ba941920fd038611bf606252f596ec0f91f8e","text":"首尔中央地方检察厅"},{"id":"A32812-zh-00008","doc":"A32812","law_id":"kr-006365-102647-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2388814","source_hash":"8bd24e393c9964e299c4180eccccca66f29192e15ae7dcf77ef6352dfe6771c0","text":"12 人"},{"id":"A32812-zh-00009","doc":"A32812","law_id":"kr-006365-102647-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2388815","source_hash":"dd8eba7efa746d23dcebd2692035c3488ef5dc609d2ef49f206ae0946dd55020","text":"89 人"},{"id":"A32812-zh-00010","doc":"A32812","law_id":"kr-006365-102647-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2388816","source_hash":"c32f5388ded45ebaa1ff5324dfbf3f57b8021f8fa9186819c0f5cf7209b52802","text":"首尔东部地方检察厅"},{"id":"A32812-zh-00011","doc":"A32812","law_id":"kr-006365-102647-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2388817","source_hash":"4e49a6bc549d19d4175d398c827208e78d2f3cfb3e8093292cf932987738a122","text":"3 人"},{"id":"A32812-zh-00012","doc":"A32812","law_id":"kr-006365-102647-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2388818","source_hash":"4e49a6bc549d19d4175d398c827208e78d2f3cfb3e8093292cf932987738a122","text":"3 人"},{"id":"A32812-zh-00013","doc":"A32812","law_id":"kr-006365-102647-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2388819","source_hash":"b9164f3fbbbd14899673f895e88b50058617ecda2281cc677fd8e692d85b6c7f","text":"首尔南部地方检察厅"},{"id":"A32812-zh-00014","doc":"A32812","law_id":"kr-006365-102647-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2388820","source_hash":"bc56a5461b320305d561895e7d65070b5f2e8c41414902f51568fbd53beccbec","text":"4 人"},{"id":"A32812-zh-00015","doc":"A32812"